###############################################
# TESTING WORKFLOW
###############################################

# STEP 1: Create Account & Get Tokens
# 1. Run request #2 (Signup)
# 2. Copy accessToken and refreshToken from response
# 3. Replace "your-access-token-here" with the token

# STEP 2: Test User Management
# 4. Run request #10 (Get Profile) - verify your account
# 5. Run request #11 (Update Profile) - change name
# 6. Run request #12 (Update Location) - set your coordinates

# STEP 3: Test Club Features
# 7. Run request #19 (Create Club)
# 8. Copy club-id from response
# 9. Run request #22 (Join Club)

# STEP 4: Test Event Features
# 10. Run request #29 (Create Event)
# 11. Copy event-id from response
# 12. Run request #36 (Register for Event) - TEST CONCURRENT SAFETY
# 13. Run request #43 (Request ETA)

# STEP 5: Test Registration & Check-in
# 14. Run request #39 (Get My Registrations)
# 15. Run request #38 (Check-in User)

# STEP 6: Test Maps & Geolocation
# 16. Run request #45 (Geocode Address)
# 17. Run request #47 (Get Route Estimate - ETA)

# STEP 7: Test Admin Features (if admin)
# 18. Run request #17 (Block User)
# 19. Run request #37 (Get Event Registrations)

