# ERROR TESTING
###############################################

### Test: Duplicate Registration (Should fail with ALREADY_REGISTERED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events/event-id-here/register
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userCoordinates": {
    "lat": 40.7128,
    "lng": -74.0060
  }
}

###############################################

### Test: Invalid Credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123@"
}

###############################################

### Test: Missing Authorization Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###############################################

### Test: Invalid Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token-here
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###############################################

### Test: Event at Capacity (Should fail with OVERBOOKED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events/full-event-id/register
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userCoordinates": {
    "lat": 40.7128,
    "lng": -74.0060
  }
}

###############################################
# NOTES
###############################################

# Variable Replacements:
# - {{baseUrl}} → http://localhost:5000
# - {{contentType}} → application/json
# - your-access-token-here → Token from login/signup
# - your-user-id → Your user ID from profile
# - club-id-here → Club ID from create/get club
# - event-id-here → Event ID from create/get event
# - registration-id-here → Registration ID from registrations list

# Expected Status Codes:
# - 200 OK → Successful GET/PUT/PATCH/DELETE
# - 201 Created → Successful POST (creates resource)
# - 400 Bad Request → Validation error
# - 401 Unauthorized → Missing/invalid token
# - 403 Forbidden → Insufficient permissions
# - 409 Conflict → Duplicate registration, event at capacity
# - 429 Too Many Requests → Rate limited
# - 500 Internal Server Error → Server error

# Features to Test:
# ✓ User authentication (signup, login, refresh)
# ✓ Profile management (view, update, location)
# ✓ Club management (create, join, members, admin)
# ✓ Event management (create, update, register, cancel)
# ✓ Concurrent registration safety (unique index, capacity)
# ✓ ETA computation (Mapbox + fallback)
# ✓ Check-in with registrations
# ✓ Geolocation (nearby users, location-based events)
# ✓ Admin features (user blocking, registration management)
# ✓ Error handling (proper error codes and messages)
# ✓ Rate limiting (multiple requests should throttle)

###############################################